      ["How long must emergency lights run on battery?", "The common standard is 90 minutes. [CONFIRM: the requirement the City applies to each building type]"],
      ["How often should exit signs be tested?", "The common standard (NFPA 101) calls for a short functional test monthly and a full-duration test yearly. [CONFIRM: the schedule Chicago enforces]"],
